      "side": 1,
      "message": "I kept the three `Protected` properties independently optional so each record only specifies what differs from the defaults. For ex, `ProtectedTargets: [\"NIC_0\"]` selects `NIC_0` on the same board. Requiring the pair would add `ProtectedBoards: [\"\"]` just to specify the default and `spdmd` would still need to check that the arrays have the same length. What do you think?",
